<title>JAPAN: HANDBALL-RESULTS OF MENS WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>HANDBALL-RESULTS OF MENS WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>KUMAMOTO, Japan 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of contest for third place on final day of Mens World Handball Championships in Kumamoto, Japan on Sunday:</p>
<p>France 28 (15) Hungary 27 (12)</p>
